To determine the recurrence relation for the sequence defined by the terms:

$$
\begin{align*}
a(0) &= 1 \\
a(1) &= -1 \\
a(2) &= -1 \\
a(3) &= 0 \\
a(4) &= -1 \\
a(5) &= 1 \\
a(6) &= -1 \\
a(7) &= -2 \\
a(8) &= -1 \\
\end{align*}
$$

we aim to find a recurrence relation that generates these values.

