Try:

$$
a(n) = -a(n-1) - a(n-2)
$$

- $ a(2) = -a(1) - a(0) = -(-1) - 1 = 0 $ ❌ (Expected -1)

Try:

$$
a(n) = a(n-1) - a(n-2)
$$

- $ a(2) = a(1) - a(0) = -1 - 1 = -2 $ ❌ (Expected -1)

Try:

$$
a(n) = a(n-2) + a(n-3)
$$

- $ a(3) = a(1) + a(0) = -1 + 1 = 0 $ ✅
- $ a(4) = a(2) + a(1) = -1 + (-1) = -2 $ ❌ (Expected -1)

